  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust Fund (LSETF)- FSD Solar/Electrical Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Field of Skills &amp; Dreams Academy is proposing to train 180 young Nigerians resident in Lagos. The company is proposing to provide trainings in solar installation and electricals. The company plans to have the training in streams of 60 persons. 3 streams per year. 3 months in class and three months internship. The company believes that there is enough demand in the market to absorb most of trainees after the training program.</narrative>
  </description>
